p>85%</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggCgdtZhmjf_text","label":"ggCgdtZhmjf_text","default":"<p>Of participants experienced better digestion and less bloating</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggSgLub39n-_text","label":"ggSgLub39n-_text","default":"<p>🧠</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggW-3QqUH5I_text","label":"ggW-3QqUH5I_text","default":"<p>75%</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg8R73xT9kt_text","label":"gg8R73xT9kt_text","default":"<p>Perform Sharper</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg92w1xvx_a_text","label":"gg92w1xvx_a_text","default":"<p>12-week randomized controlled trial</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggThX2uuYnF_text","label":"ggThX2uuYnF_text","default":"<p>Trust &amp; Certification</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggnUEbxAyBW_text","label":"ggnUEbxAyBW_text","default":"<p>NSF Certified for Sport</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gga-uOKI8Zl_childItem_0","label":"gga-uOKI8Zl_childItem_0","default":"<p>280+ Substances Tested</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gga-uOKI8Zl_childItem_1","label":"gga-uOKI8Zl_childItem_1","default":"<p>Third-Party Verified</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggFbcVGHxK2_text","label":"ggFbcVGHxK2_text","default":"<p>Aryna Sabalenka</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggKCDAHxg-W_text","label":"ggKCDAHxg-W_text","default":"<p>World No. 1 Tennis Player NSF Certifie</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggfO1V29hBX_text","label":"ggfO1V29hBX_text","default":"A Note from David Beckham"},{"type":"html","id":"gg36LGMvjFY_text","label":"gg36LGMvjFY_text","default":"<p>I've been fortunate to work with some of the world's top medical professionals, nutrition experts, and fitness coaches throughout my life. Their guidance has always been crucial to my health. Since retiring from football, I've focused even more on eating well and staying informed about the latest science in health and supplements.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggwZdM-rgJT_text","label":"ggwZdM-rgJT_text","default":"<p>Supplements have been a part of my daily routine for years, but I've often felt overwhelmed by how many different products it takes to truly support your body. That's why IM8 is so different — it's simplified everything for me.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggQNGwzcE7r_text","label":"ggQNGwzcE7r_text","default":"<p>Since taking IM8 daily, I've genuinely felt better — more energy, better focus, and just a stronger sense of overall wellness. And one of the best parts? It tastes amazing — like a refreshing blend of acai and mixed berries. It's something I look forward to drinking every morning.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggsFZmo7pAp_text","label":"ggsFZmo7pAp_text","default":"<p>I've shared IM8 with my friends and family, and everyone's felt the difference — whether it's more energy, better sleep or just feeling like they're finally on top of their health. That's what it's all about.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggvKF4s2kSu_text","label":"ggvKF4s2kSu_text","default":"<p>We've built a world-class scientific advisory board with leaders in medicine, nutrition, and even space science. Every ingredient in IM8 is selected with intention and backed by rigorous research. That's what makes it different — and why I trust it for my own health.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggki5lqavCH_text","label":"ggki5lqavCH_text","default":"<p>For me, taking care of my health means being present for my family and living fully, every day. IM8 helps me do that — and I am so proud of what we've built.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMmt1rIcR__text","label":"ggMmt1rIcR__text","default":"<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong>David Beckham</strong></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggzDiQY0JvY_text","label":"ggzDiQY0JvY_text","default":"<p><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:14px;\">Co-Founding Partner</span></p>"}],
